# jasmin/ASSUMPTIONS
# ==================
#
# What `Print Assumptions` reports for the end-to-end compiler theorem and
# for the two architecture records the components compile for, one name per
# line under each query. build.sh stops if a report differs, in either
# direction, so a change of the theorem's assumptions is a reviewed change.
#
# - PrimInt63.*, Uint63Axioms.*, Sint63Axioms.*, Int63.*: Rocq's primitive
#   63-bit integers and the axioms that specify them.
# - ProofIrrelevance.proof_irrelevance, Eqdep.Eq_rect_eq.eq_rect_eq: standard
#   axioms of the Rocq library.
# - label.encode_label, label.decode_label, label.decode_encode_label: the
#   encoding of code labels as machine words, left abstract
#   (proofs/arch/label.v).
# - waes.MixColumns, waes.InvMixColumns: the AES column mixing used by the
#   x86-64 AES instructions, left abstract (proofs/lang/waes.v).

